        "original_id": "d23f6115-a277-54f8-ac22-5dc6b0923624",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Priyadarshan, Jackie Shroff, Dimple Kapadia, Shajith Koyeri\n- Companies: Shogun Films\n- Products: Gardish, Kabhi Na Kabhi, Omkara\n- Events: Filmfare Awards, National Film Awards, IIFA Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Shroff, born Jaikishen Kakubhai Shroff on 1 February 1957, is an Indian actor.\n- Gardish is a 1993 Hindi film directed by Priyadarshan and starring Jackie Shroff and Dimple Kapadia.\n- Jackie Shroff was nominated for a Best Actor Filmfare Award for Gardish.\n- Dimple Kapadia was nominated for a Best Supporting Actress Filmfare Award for Gardish.\n- Shogun Films produced the Hindi films Gardish and Kabhi Na Kabhi, which introduced director Priyadarshan in Bollywood.\n- Shajith Koyeri won a National Film Award for sound design on Omkara.\n- Shajith Koyeri also won two Filmfare Awards and two IIFA Awards.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
